{#-
ErsatzRS built-in "Music Factory" (TMF) artist/title lower-third preset.

Engine: ersatzrs:minijinja — this template is evaluated by minijinja (ADR 0076),
not the legacy fixed-token substitution, so every size, margin and position is
computed here from the output resolution and the card is identical at 720p,
1080p, 4K, etc. The leading marker on the line above selects that engine.

Context provided by ersatzrs-infra (render_minijinja_template):
  resolution.width, resolution.height, artist, all_artists, title, album,
  track, plot, release_date, studios, directors, duration_seconds,
  stream_seek_seconds.

Layout (bottom-left): two equal-width stacked bars, each 73% of the frame width,
faded in/out like the default song-title card. The top bar is black with the
gold artist name; the bottom bar is gold with the black song title (a straight
colour inversion). Bars are drawn rectangles so both share the same width;
paired with the recommended "MUSIC FACTORY" image overlay (18% wide, 3% right
margin) this leaves a ~3% gap between the bars and the logo. Colours are the TMF
brand gold #EFB832 (ASS &H32B8EF&) with black. The "MUSIC FACTORY" wordmark and
the TMF channel bug are persistent brand marks delivered as separate always-on
graphics/watermark overlays rather than baked into this per-song card.
-#}
{%- set w = resolution.width -%}
{%- set h = resolution.height -%}
{%- set fs = (h / 20) | round | int -%}
{%- set outline = [ (h / 135) | round | int, 2 ] | max -%}
{%- set ml = (w * 0.03) | round | int -%}
{%- set mb = (h * 0.05) | round | int -%}
{%- set bar_h = fs + 2 * outline -%}
{%- set bar_w = (w * 0.73) | round | int -%}
{%- set pad = (h * 0.015) | round | int -%}
{%- set title_bottom = h - mb -%}
{%- set title_top = title_bottom - bar_h -%}
{%- set artist_top = title_top - bar_h -%}
{%- set title_mid = title_top + bar_h // 2 -%}
{%- set artist_mid = artist_top + bar_h // 2 -%}
{%- set text_x = ml + pad -%}
{%- set artist_text = (all_artists | join(' / ') if all_artists else artist) | upper -%}
{%- set title_text = title | upper -%}
[Script Info]
ScriptType: v4.00+
WrapStyle: 2
ScaledBorderAndShadow: yes
YCbCr Matrix: None
PlayResX: {{ w }}
PlayResY: {{ h }}

[V4+ Styles]
Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Encoding
Style: TmfBar,OPTIKabel-Heavy,{{ fs }},&H32B8EF&,&H32B8EF&,&H32B8EF&,&H000000&,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,7,0,0,0,1
Style: TmfArtist,OPTIKabel-Heavy,{{ fs }},&H32B8EF&,&H32B8EF&,&H000000&,&H000000&,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,4,0,0,0,1
Style: TmfTitle,OPTIKabel-Heavy,{{ fs }},&H000000&,&H000000&,&H000000&,&H000000&,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,4,0,0,0,1

[Events]
Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:16.00,TmfBar,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos({{ ml }},{{ artist_top }})\1c&H000000&\p1\fad(1200,1200)}m 0 0 l {{ bar_w }} 0 {{ bar_w }} {{ bar_h }} 0 {{ bar_h }}{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:16.00,TmfBar,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos({{ ml }},{{ title_top }})\1c&H32B8EF&\p1\fad(1200,1200)}m 0 0 l {{ bar_w }} 0 {{ bar_w }} {{ bar_h }} 0 {{ bar_h }}{\p0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.00,0:00:16.00,TmfArtist,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos({{ text_x }},{{ artist_mid }})\fad(1200,1200)}{{ artist_text }}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.00,0:00:16.00,TmfTitle,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos({{ text_x }},{{ title_mid }})\fad(1200,1200)}{{ title_text }}
